WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.539
Welcome to the team,
Mr. Wise.

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:08.007
Thank you.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:12.211
Now, being an Arizona
Assistant State's Attorney

00:00:12.244 --> 00:00:13.746
is an important job,

00:00:13.779 --> 00:00:15.648
one we take
very seriously.

00:00:15.681 --> 00:00:19.419
In fact, we are willing
to do anything to win.

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:20.987
It's my honor, sir.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.388
And I look forward to serving
the state of Arizona.

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:24.090
Are these marbles?

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:25.992
How's that?

00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:29.362
I was just admiring
your container of marbles.

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:31.197
Why, yes.

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:33.866
My wife got them for me
as a gift...

00:00:33.899 --> 00:00:35.101
Oh.

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:37.203
For my birthday.

00:00:37.236 --> 00:00:39.405
Which brings me
to a speech

00:00:39.438 --> 00:00:42.408
I like to give anyone
on their first day

00:00:42.441 --> 00:00:44.944
here at
the state's attorney office

00:00:44.977 --> 00:00:47.113
of Arizona.

00:00:47.146 --> 00:00:50.216
You see...
Lady Justice

00:00:50.249 --> 00:00:51.884
is a committed woman.

00:00:51.917 --> 00:00:53.953
She's a slippery
little scallop,

00:00:53.986 --> 00:00:55.388
as you can observe...

00:00:55.421 --> 00:00:58.391
[dramatic music]

00:00:58.424 --> 00:01:02.095
♪ ♪

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:03.696
She doesn't cook,
doesn't clean,

00:01:03.729 --> 00:01:06.799
but what she does do,
is she'll turn a blind eye...

00:01:06.832 --> 00:01:15.408
♪ ♪

00:01:15.441 --> 00:01:17.477
What is going on?

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.478
What?

00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:19.946
What are you doing?

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:21.147
Oh, uh...

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:22.915
I don't--

00:01:22.948 --> 00:01:24.417
The marbles, they're just--

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:26.786
I got to tell you,
they're just so beautiful.

00:01:26.819 --> 00:01:28.287
I was wondering
what it would feel like

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:29.822
to--in my mouth.

00:01:29.855 --> 00:01:31.390
Like, what would
the marbles feel like

00:01:31.423 --> 00:01:32.391
if they were in my mouth?

00:01:32.424 --> 00:01:34.660
[laughs]
That's...you know.

00:01:34.693 --> 00:01:36.262
What?

00:01:36.295 --> 00:01:38.264
Just, you know...you know.

00:01:38.297 --> 00:01:39.632
Like, just what would
it feel like

00:01:39.665 --> 00:01:42.135
if there were just kind of
a whole ton of marbles

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:45.138
in my--in my face.

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:47.240
Well, don't do that.

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:48.808
Just...

00:01:48.841 --> 00:01:49.842
Just don't do that.

00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:52.745
Yeah, yeah, of course,
of course.

00:01:52.778 --> 00:01:54.480
What am I doing over here?

00:01:54.513 --> 00:01:56.816
I mean, that's a thing
that a child would do, it is.

00:01:56.849 --> 00:01:59.819
You were saying?

00:01:59.852 --> 00:02:02.588
I was saying
that Lady Justice,

00:02:02.621 --> 00:02:05.625
she just stands there
in my office,

00:02:05.658 --> 00:02:06.993
looking at me.

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:14.968
♪ ♪

00:02:29.848 --> 00:02:32.518
Hey!

00:02:32.551 --> 00:02:34.587
Forget the marbles, boy!

00:02:36.655 --> 00:02:39.725
Spit the marbles out,
please.

00:02:39.758 --> 00:02:42.061
There you go.

00:02:42.094 --> 00:02:44.764
[marbles clacking]

00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:50.670
Well...

00:02:50.703 --> 00:02:51.738
All right.

00:02:54.106 --> 00:02:55.275
Ah--

00:02:57.209 --> 00:02:58.111
[marble clacks]

00:03:00.679 --> 00:03:02.849
How many--really?

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:06.052
Do you have any--

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:07.019
[marble rolling]

00:03:07.052 --> 00:03:09.055
[stomps]

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:11.424
I'm gonna wait
for the last--

00:03:11.457 --> 00:03:12.425
I'm assuming there's--

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:15.661
Yeah.

00:03:15.694 --> 00:03:17.697
I know there's another one
in there.

00:03:21.433 --> 00:03:23.269
- Nope.
- All right.

00:03:24.737 --> 00:03:27.340
I am so--I'm--they're just
so beautiful.

00:03:27.373 --> 00:03:28.541
I can't--
it's just these marbles.

00:03:28.574 --> 00:03:30.009
I got to tell you.

00:03:30.042 --> 00:03:31.410
You obviously don't
take this job very seriously.

00:03:31.443 --> 00:03:32.678
I do, sir.

00:03:32.711 --> 00:03:33.879
It's just these
particular marbles.

00:03:33.912 --> 00:03:35.181
I just needed to feel

00:03:35.214 --> 00:03:36.716
what they felt like
in my mouth.

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:39.118
I don't know what is wrong
with me.

00:03:39.151 --> 00:03:40.786
You know we do serious
business here, right?

00:03:40.819 --> 00:03:41.921
Yes, I do know that.

00:03:41.954 --> 00:03:43.289
I'm 100% aware of that.

00:03:43.322 --> 00:03:45.224
'Cause I've forgotten
where I was.

00:03:45.257 --> 00:03:46.525
You were saying that Justice

00:03:46.558 --> 00:03:48.261
is a dumb, blind, old lady.
I heard every word.

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:49.262
Yes--no!

00:03:49.295 --> 00:03:51.631
She's not dumb.

00:03:53.766 --> 00:03:55.735
But she is blind.

00:03:55.768 --> 00:03:58.371
She's reminiscent
of Kerry Washington

00:03:58.404 --> 00:03:59.105
in her prime.

00:03:59.138 --> 00:04:08.047
♪ ♪

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:09.749
Good God.

00:04:09.782 --> 00:04:13.386
[muffled shouting]

00:04:13.419 --> 00:04:15.488
[muffled yelping]

00:04:15.521 --> 00:04:18.458
[muffled shouting]

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:24.897
[coughing]

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:26.332
[choking]

00:04:26.365 --> 00:04:28.067
[muffled groaning]

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:30.436
[choking]

00:04:34.006 --> 00:04:36.976
[marbles clattering]

00:04:37.009 --> 00:04:39.979
[atmospheric choral music]

00:04:40.012 --> 00:04:47.520
♪ ♪

00:04:47.553 --> 00:04:48.788
[intercom beeps]

00:04:48.821 --> 00:04:53.526
Janice, send in
the cleanup crew.

00:04:53.559 --> 00:04:57.697
Another one fell
for the marble trick.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:00.333
[chuckling]

00:05:02.334 --> 00:05:04.337
[humming]

